This tests the script tag with a minimal snippet of Python code.

<H2>Expected Output</H2>

It adds 2 and 2.  you should see "4" below between the two lines.
<BR><BR>
<HR>
<BR><CENTER>
{{script}}
print 2+2
{{endscript}}
</CENTER><BR>
<HR>

